<title>UK: Libya postpones sugar tender until Monday - traders.</title>
<headline>Libya postpones sugar tender until Monday - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya has postponed its tender to buy white sugar until Monday, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Earlier this week, Libya was reported to be in the market to buy at least one cargo of quality 45 ICUMSA sugar, most likely for nearby or May shipment.</p>
<p>Traders said Libya could take more than one cargo if suppliers offered attractive prices but was unlikely to take any decision quickly.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
